title: Digital Gauge Numeric Temperatures Display (Engine & Trans)
raw_community_title: Digital Engine and Transmission Temperature Gauges in 12" cluster
category: Cluster and Displays
platform: Ranger (6G)
model_years: 2024+
trim: All
source_sheet: (2024+) 6G Ranger.xlsx
steps:
- module: IPC
  address: 720-07-01
  notes: 'highly recommend to use the non asbuilt menu option instead of the asbuilt,
    or just set the * to 5 to enable both Engine and tranny temp

    * Bits4 and 3 (set bit 4 to 0 and bit 3 to 1 for Always on )

    FORScan Menu: Digital Engine Temperature Gauge (Config 2 (Default), Enabled)

    Trim: All [Confirmed: craigc (9/16/2024) Lariat]'
  targets:
  - mask: xxxx xx*x xx--
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 0
      feature_name: Eng Temp Dig (ETD)
      target_state: ETD Always On
    - bit: 2
      action: 1
      feature_name: Eng Temp Dig (ETD)
      target_state: ETD Always On
    - bit: 1
      action: 0
      feature_name: Trans Temp Dig (TTD)
      target_state: TTD Always On
    - bit: 0
      action: 1
      feature_name: Trans Temp Dig (TTD)
      target_state: TTD Always On
- module: IPC
  address: 720-07-01
  notes: 'highly recommend to use the non asbuilt menu option instead of the asbuilt,
    or just set the * to 5 to enable both Engine and tranny temp

    * Bits2 and 1 (set bit 2 to 0 and bit 1 to 1 for Always on )

    FORScan Menu: Digital Transmission Temperature Gauge (Config 2 (Default), Enabled)

    Trim: All [Confirmed: craigc (9/16/2024) Lariat]'
  targets:
  - mask: xxxx xx*x xx--
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 0
      feature_name: Eng Temp Dig (ETD)
      target_state: ETD Always On
    - bit: 2
      action: 1
      feature_name: Eng Temp Dig (ETD)
      target_state: ETD Always On
    - bit: 1
      action: 0
      feature_name: Trans Temp Dig (TTD)
      target_state: TTD Always On
    - bit: 0
      action: 1
      feature_name: Trans Temp Dig (TTD)
      target_state: TTD Always On
recipe_version: '1.1'
